WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.035
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.035 --> 00:00:04.504
We're really excited
to get started

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.873
and, now, we're going
to get to the news.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:09.241
According to a new report
from the Labor Department,

00:00:09.241 --> 00:00:13.613
U.S. consumer prices are surging
more than they have in 30 years.

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:16.883
Okay, how much more bad news
is Biden going to get?

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.317
[ Laughter ]
At the end of the month,

00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:20.219
we're going to find out
the turkey he pardoned was

00:00:20.219 --> 00:00:22.354
at the Capitol on January 6th.

00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:23.889
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:23.889 --> 00:00:27.126
A federal judge ruled last night
that former President Trump

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:28.561
cannot shield
White House records

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:29.929
from the House Select Committee

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:32.364
investigating
January's Capitol attack.

00:00:32.364 --> 00:00:33.967
Oh, he really wants to, though.

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:35.434
He's acting like a boyfriend

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:37.703
who just had his phone snatched
out of his hand.

00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:40.206
"You don't have to hold it
to look at it!

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.142
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:44.210
I will just show it to you,
but don't scroll!

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:47.146
[ Laughter ]
Uh, scrolling uses up battery!

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:48.515
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:50.082
During a visit
to the White House on Monday

00:00:50.082 --> 00:00:53.385
to celebrate winning
the 2021 NBA Championship,

00:00:53.385 --> 00:00:55.387
the Milwaukee Bucks
gave President Biden

00:00:55.387 --> 00:00:57.957
a custom jersey
with the number 46 on the back

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:00.126
and he was really excited
because he thought it was

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:01.227
his approval rating.

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:03.462
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.462 --> 00:01:05.532
Twitter yesterday launched
its so-called

00:01:05.532 --> 00:01:08.101
Twitter Blue subscription
service in the U.S.,

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:10.403
which will cost
around $3 per month

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:13.673
and allow users to undo tweets
before they post.

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:16.642
Or, for $6 per month,
you can get Twitter Gold,

00:01:16.642 --> 00:01:19.012
and they'll just delete
your account entirely.

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:20.846
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.846 --> 00:01:23.049
After missing this week's game,
due to COVID,

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:24.717
Green Bay quarterback
Aaron Rodgers said,

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:26.452
in a new interview,
that he has had

00:01:26.452 --> 00:01:29.455
"a lot of time for reflection
while in quarantine."

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:31.658
Unfortunately,
he does all his best thinking

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:33.793
in the shower
and, as you can see...

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:36.763
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.397 --> 00:01:41.567
Television host Dr. Oz is
reportedly considering running

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:43.169
for a senate seat
in Pennsylvania.

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:47.206
What? Who would ever want Dr. Oz
to be their senator?

00:01:47.206 --> 00:01:48.474
The only thing crazier would be

00:01:48.474 --> 00:01:51.310
wanting Dr. Oz to be
your doctor.

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:53.746
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:55.948
It was announced today
that actor Paul Rudd is

00:01:55.948 --> 00:01:57.783
People magazine's
Sexiest Man Alive,

00:01:57.783 --> 00:02:00.186
reclaiming the title
he first received

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:01.854
in 1938.

00:02:01.854 --> 00:02:04.858
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.526 --> 00:02:10.029
A middle school history teacher
in California

00:02:10.029 --> 00:02:11.097
was recently removed

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:12.698
after telling students
last month

00:02:12.698 --> 00:02:14.334
that Donald Trump
was still president.

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:15.668
Though, for what it's worth,

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:18.104
I bet she's still telling people
she's a teacher.

00:02:18.104 --> 00:02:20.940
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:23.642
Rapper Kanye West's
clothing brand Yeezy

00:02:23.642 --> 00:02:26.112
settled a lawsuit this week
with the state of California

00:02:26.112 --> 00:02:27.213
over shipping delays

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:29.115
and agreed to pay
nearly $1 million,

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:30.249
or, as it's known at Yeezy,

00:02:30.249 --> 00:02:31.317
a shirt.

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:33.218
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.218 --> 00:02:35.488
Finally,
according to a new survey,

00:02:35.488 --> 00:02:38.257
40% of Americans said
that they strongly approve

00:02:38.257 --> 00:02:41.060
of "Sesame Street's" Big Bird
announcing on social media

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.695
that he got
a coronavirus vaccine.

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:44.830
They were less comfortable,
though, with hearing

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:47.367
why Oscar needed
the hep C vaccine.

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:49.035
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:50.770
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

